@startuml SD-XXX
' Traceability: UC-XXX | RB-XXX
' UC-XXX: <Use Case Title>

' Lifelines — one per boundary and entity from the robustness diagram
actor       "User"            as U
boundary    "ScreenName"      as B
control     "DoSomething"     as C
entity      "DomainClass"     as E

' ── Basic Course ────────────────────────────────────────────

group Step 1 — <UC step 1 user action>
  U -> B : submitAction()
  B -> C : process()
end

group Step 2 — <UC step 2 system response>
  C -> E : getData()
  E --> C : data
  C --> B : result
  B --> U : displayResult()
end

' ── Alternate Course A: <name> ──────────────────────────────

group Alternate A1 — <UC alternate step text> #Pink
  C -> B : showError()
  B --> U : displayError()
end

' ── Alternate Course B: <name> ──────────────────────────────

group Alternate B1 — <UC alternate step text> #Pink
  B --> U : displayWarning()
end

note over U, E
  Traceability:
  - UC: UC-XXX
  - Robustness: RB-XXX
  - Class model: (updated by Developer)
  - Test cases: (filled by Tester)
end note

@enduml
